						<div class="fl-row-content fl-row-fixed-width fl-node-content">
		
<div class="fl-col-group fl-node-a0qvg8rlyp1x" data-node="a0qvg8rlyp1x">
			<div class="fl-col fl-node-ebs7h96a3mct fl-col-bg-color" data-node="ebs7h96a3mct">
	<div class="fl-col-content fl-node-content"><div  class="fl-module fl-module-rich-text fl-rich-text fl-node-dzuvfrjmoqw9 fl-animation fl-fade-up" data-node="dzuvfrjmoqw9" data-animation-delay="0" data-animation-duration="1">
	<p><strong>A Century of Commitment to Education and Innovation</strong></p>
<p>Welcome to Universiti Pendidikan Sultan Idris (UPSI), a premier university of education in Malaysia and one of the nation’s leading public institutions of higher learning. With its origins as Sultan Idris Training College (SITC) in 1922 and its official establishment as UPSI on 1st May 1997, UPSI has a proud tradition of delivering quality education in Malaysia, shaping the future of educators and professionals across various disciplines.</p>
<p>Located in the serene town of Tanjong Malim, Perak Darul Ridzuan, UPSI operates two campuses - Sultan Abdul Jalil Shah Campus (KSAJS) and Sultan Azlan Shah Campus (KSAS) - which combine historical heritage with a vision for global educational excellence. Through comprehensive UPSI education programmes - including teaching, research, publication, community service, and international collaboration activities - the university is committed to driving excellence in human capital development.</p>
<p>We invite you to join our vibrant community and be part of the legacy of excellence in education at UPSI, where we empower students to become the best educators and future leaders.</p>
</div>
<style>.fl-node-dzuvfrjmoqw9.fl-animation:not(.fl-animated){opacity:0}</style></div>
</div>
